# Runbook

Diagnostic runbook for common end-user issues, structured as symptom-based troubleshooting trees. Each doc walks through a decision tree for a single symptom category — what to check first, how to branch based on what you find, and when to stop digging and escalate.

This exercise is meant to mirror teir 1 help desk user issues

